 "words_heard": 200,
 "words": 207,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A very large assembly gathered around",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Men women and children all in the crowd",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Weeping bitterly before the house of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Confessing our sins as the tears did flow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shecaniah spoke up from the Elam line",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We have been unfaithful to God divine",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet now there is hope for Israel still",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Send away all these women as we will",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only Jonathan and Jahzeiah opposed this",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Meshullam and Shabbethai stood with his",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They trembled at the command of our Lord",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to the Law it was recorded",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A proclamation went out to Judah and Ben",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gather in Jerusalem within three days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or forfeit your property and be excluded",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The leaders and elders made this decree",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only Jonathan and Jahzeiah opposed this",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Meshullam and Shabbethai stood with his",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They trembled at the command of our Lord",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to the Law it was recorded",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the twentieth of the ninth month we sat",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the open square in the heavy rain",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trembling because of this matter so grave",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The weight of the covenant was on us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the first of the tenth to the first of the first",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We finished dealing with all the men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who had married foreign women in the land",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The work of the commission was done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
